Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.92,0:00:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you believe in gravity\Nbetween individuals?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you believe that fate brought\Nus together for a reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why in God's name? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it have to end like this? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I just die and be with Perla?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My fury isn't satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.26,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay right here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether I'm going to eliminate you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And those without any memories\Nleft are as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.46,0:01:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.98,0:02:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know how to drive properly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.66,0:02:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not be driving\Nlike this on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right, like I have the\Ncomposure to mess around!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.32,0:02:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,These bugs are eating me alive, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.21,0:02:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense Poochie in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.94,0:02:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And Weather is there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.98,0:02:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they together?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say that with all certainty,\Nbut I know they're near each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.47,0:02:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What the actual hell did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:03:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to kill you?\NI do. Cut the bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.74,0:03:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.22,0:03:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember this happening\Naround me once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.76,0:03:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In my hometown in 1988. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It would seem this freak show\Nrepresents the darkest side of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.34,0:03:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your memories, they really are back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.06,0:03:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So you remember everything now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then get your act together\Nand do something about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.86,0:03:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no control over this ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Though if you kill me, the Stan's power\Nshould stop. I do kind of feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,for the snail people but a part of me\Nhates living even more and that part is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.68,0:03:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,enjoying the hell out of this somewhere\Ndown in the deepest recesses of my
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,heart I feel some relief to be honest I'm\Nsort of glad this happened what are you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but Jolene if she's nearby\Ncould she be turning
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.82,0:03:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,into a snail too you\Nbetter not Move carelessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea how all this works,\Nbut judging by what I can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.90,0:04:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,it's likely that touching these snails\Nis the trigger to this phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Moreover, if you turn snail,\Nthere'll be no one left to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.06,0:04:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of fucking nonsense is\Ncoming out of your mouth, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me where Jolene is right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, fine, but only after we\Nsettle things with Poochie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, that so-called\Npriest is somewhere nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What really? Where he's here at this\Npoint, my only hope for staying alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,is to settle things between us once\Nand for all from what happened to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.64,0:04:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,ff to sealing away jolene's father's\Nmemories for his own selfish desires
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.94,0:04:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,to come to fruition i'll settle it\Nall i'll be the one to kill poochie
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.30,0:04:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And once he's taken care of\Nyou, kill me, got it, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever i still owe ff a\Nbig one anyways i'm with you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,speaking of which where's\Nthe priest is he north or
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:05:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,south it isn't about where\Nhe's coming from the man's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,already here and he's\Nsomewhere within 20 meters of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,us i've already done a quick\Nsweep for him underground
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,using my diver drive all\Ni can see are these snails
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.78,0:05:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you positive he's closing\Nin on us through all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no disturbance\Nin the air currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't sense anything in the\Narea breathing or moving around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.66,0:05:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he's hiding\Ninside that car, Weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.68,0:06:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I am already well aware of how that\Nweather-controlling ability of yours functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.50,0:06:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This phenomenon that turns\Nanything man or beast into snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.18,0:06:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I understand the\Nsecret behind why it happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I have absolutely no reason to be\Nafraid of the snails touching my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've uncovered how this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,although it took me a while to figure out\Nthe specific intricacies of your ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have overcome it once\Nbefore when I removed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your memories in 1988. Son of a damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:06:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over for you now, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.72,0:07:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have stayed out of my\Nbusiness and away from Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.68,0:07:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But instead of patiently\Nwaiting for your prison
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,sentence to end you chose\Nto end your own life!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.54,0:07:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How is Poochie standing there unscathed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.52,0:07:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,These snails don't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here, Weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, let's call it good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're planning to die sometime\Nsoon, Weather, hold off for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.78,0:07:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I cut your leg off so it would take\Na few hours for you to bleed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,With this deadly phenomenon\Nyou cause still in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be the perfect weapon for putting an
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,end to all nuisances who\Nattempt to oppose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.46,0:07:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I now know who will be raising\Nme up to attain heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether it turns out to\Nbe you, not anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have three days until the new moon\Narrives, and then it will finally begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:08:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment that the green baby\Ndesired will come to pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and the manifestation of\Nheaven that Dio strived for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,will take root inside of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.42,0:08:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With Diver Drive, I gave Weather a leg
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,by phasing into his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.26,0:08:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab the priest and bring\Nhim closer, Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.18,0:08:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your big brother's stand\Nisn't a power type like yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.18,0:08:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can keep a hold of him, you\Ncan outmatch him at point-blank range!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you dare let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.90,0:08:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,White?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't even anywhere\Nnear touching the snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:08:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Poochie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of game are you playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.82,0:09:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Subliminal messaging.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The method of cleverly\Narranging hidden words on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,a poster that cannot be\Nnoticed at first glance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a single frame containing an image that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,has been clipped into the film of a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The average person is unaware\Nof ever having seen the image.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.94,0:09:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But without a doubt,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it becomes carved into their deep\Nconsciousness and lingers there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's what psychologists\Nrefer to as subliminal
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.74,0:09:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,messaging and the effect\Nit has on the subconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Things or images that are\Ninstinctive penetrate much further
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.36,0:09:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,into one's consciousness more than\Nif they are witnessed directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And as a result of this, they control\Nwhat an individual may decide to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.42,0:09:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And now the rainbow's weather forecast\Nconjured are having that same effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's becoming a subliminal\Nmessage at an atmospheric level.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And whenever they lay their eyes on them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.76,0:09:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,it's entering the souls\Nof the townspeople.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because images of snails\Nare being projected onto them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.60,0:09:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Or could it be because it\Nstimulates primitive instincts?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:10:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone who looks at the rainbow starts\Nto think that they too will become snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And these intense thoughts affect\Nthe subjects physically as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to explain here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the true answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.62,0:10:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth behind the ability\Nweather forecast had sealed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.29,0:10:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,when the same phenomenon occurred to\Nthe innocent people in my hometown,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw that a blind old woman was\Ncompletely unaffected and that's when
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I understood the solution to getting\Nrid of this strange occurrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.98,0:10:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Being blind, you can't\Nweather even if I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still sense where\Nyou are with my intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And this will work long after I've\Nremoved my ability to use my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.62,0:10:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But let me tell you closing your\Neyes now will not save you Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.86,0:10:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no way to escape\Nfrom the subliminal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,messaging once it has dug\Nits roots into your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.70,0:10:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as weather\Ncontinues to draw breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.50,0:10:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,this destructive\Nphenomenon will never end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll take your other leg as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.44,0:11:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not stand ever\Nagain! Dive or try!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.84,0:11:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare lash out at me\Nwith your insignificant feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.64,0:11:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans must strive to\Nreach the gates of heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and the one who is the\Nfirst to find and attain
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it will be able to lead\Nall of mankind to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.90,0:11:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are merely\Ninterfering with my progress!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All because I have to sacrifice the lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,of a few people to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Diamon Quo Fats!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.86,0:11:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To be crucified!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now die for your sins!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,this is your doing isn't it weather what\Nare you up to now what is this atrocious
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,scraping sound what on earth do you think\Nyou're doing something that i can control
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.74,0:11:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,one of weather forecasts abilities\Nit doesn't have to be fast
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:12:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but if i make it precise and if\Ni keep it simple he's evaporating
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.74,0:12:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,his blood freezing it in the air\Nand hardening it weather's He's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.86,0:12:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,using all the blood on the ground\Nto surround him with spears,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and the priest can't even see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are you gonna choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the option to continue\Nthis without the use of your vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And the other option\Nthat you have to choose
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,from is seeing what's going\Non with your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you trip and\Nfall, it's over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.38,0:12:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come, Pucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done, Poochie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you're\Ngoing to escape from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to bring your eyesight back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and try.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just reflect the rainbow\Nstraight into your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.60,0:12:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If weather can grab you, your\Nchances of survival are slim to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In terms of power, Pale\NSnake is simply outclassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.06,0:12:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather's got this in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:12:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.55,0:13:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I anticipated that you\Nwould try to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.02,0:13:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There is not a reality where you\Nwould ever let me go peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You who has finally\Nregained his lost memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,However!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.05,0:13:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There are eyes for me to\Nsee out of from all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I was able to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.94,0:13:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia, may I use you for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall act as a substitute for my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you kindly relate to me\Nwhat you see in front of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.90,0:13:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Specifically the things\Nthat are dangerous to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Weather doing currently?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hardening his own\Nblood to create a few
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.66,0:13:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,dozen spears all over\Nthe ground around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There are three of them\Nplaced directly behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then to your right there\Nare four more lying in wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.66,0:13:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now be a good boy and guide me out\Nof this maze of blood spears, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take three steps,\Nyou'll meet six spears.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,From there, you're gonna\Nwant to take a hard left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,From the very moment you were\Nborn, a curse has afflicted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.06,0:14:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay there silently, just as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what you attempt to do,\Nthere is no salvation for your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.86,0:14:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The memories I sealed away should never
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,have been returned to\Nyou in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.06,0:14:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue going left for\Nfive steps, then face right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.30,0:14:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, you're free from any danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.52,0:14:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.43,0:14:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Five more steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct. Just five.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.48,0:14:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is something I just realized,\Nbut I saw it, so I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One more spear still remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.10,0:14:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only looking at the ground,\Nso I didn't notice before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.84,0:14:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's some blood on your shoulder,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and right about now, weather's\Nhardening it into another spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.84,0:14:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Eww, playing these dirty tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.90,0:14:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell any of this is dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.18,0:14:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather's just stronger than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.78,0:14:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why he's gonna win!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This wind pressure's soaked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.80,0:15:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I must get as far away as I can from\Nthe range of his stand immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to dodge this one blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can dodge it, then Weather's\Nstamina should reach its limits!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.36,0:15:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get impaled by your own blood spears!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That attack's nothing to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.38,0:15:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He can dodge it easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I have no doubt that he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But then the direction of his\Nwind pressure will change.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my chance to flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.50,0:15:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've finally got you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't dodge them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather actually took the spears\Nand use them to capture the priests!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's within Weather's range!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.04,0:16:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,While you were in Green\NDolphin Street Prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have finished you off at any given\Nmoment if I truly wanted to. Except I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,had it in my head that one day I could save\Nyou which is why I stole your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.86,0:16:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't some convenient excuses\Nif I'm begging for my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Prime numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I did all the wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.39,0:16:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've worked tirelessly towards my goal of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.96,0:16:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,attaining the power so that\Nboth of us can prosper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be someone who obtains\Nthe power to reach heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.40,0:16:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It was It's faded to happen eventually!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.47,0:16:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.08,0:16:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not an end to both of our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.86,0:16:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Seventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.77,0:16:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The kind of evil that doesn't\Neven realize it's evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the most disgusting kind of them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:16:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nineteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.91,0:16:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pooch is afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.16,0:17:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,His expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's fear and despair written\Nall over his face! Twenty-three. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.50,0:17:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.38,0:17:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the one who's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.60,0:17:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the cursed one, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the man who kept you alive,\Nand this is how you remain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.36,0:17:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.27,0:17:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Die, Keicho!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you that if you\Ntried anything weird, I'd kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.65,0:17:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a sudden cloud\Nof dust and then a stray
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.86,0:17:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,nail or something stabbed\Nstraight through the tire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.96,0:17:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't my fault I lost control!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, he's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather is somewhere nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.52,0:17:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The priest, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.00,0:17:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, something looks off outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.26,0:17:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see very well, but there's\Nsomething strange covering up the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.47,0:17:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're close by!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Respond to me! Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.20,0:17:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of crazy horror scene is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.12,0:18:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense the priest\Nmoving around nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.74,0:18:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's super close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.36,0:18:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to find Weather\Nfast before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling that something\Nterrible is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this wind being stirred\Nup by Weather's ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Has that damn priest not\Nturned into a snail yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I honestly have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I only know that he's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.10,0:18:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I just saw someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.46,0:18:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.12,0:18:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's weather or the\Npriest, but they're in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.02,0:18:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, the wind's starting to disperse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.02,0:18:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, my body's turning back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.36,0:18:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,OUCHI!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.42,0:18:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.94,0:18:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bodies and stands\Nstill haven't recovered
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,all the way from\Ntransitioning into snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:19:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't beat the priest now\Nin terms of power and speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.48,0:19:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find weather first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.46,0:19:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if we beat the priest,\Nwe can find weather, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.30,0:19:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.10,0:19:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Join!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.82,0:19:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the? Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody is capable of\Ncatching up to me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest you enjoy the\Nrest of the days you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.86,0:19:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,have left with your family and loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming after me now is utterly useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.22,0:19:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I always win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This man is no longer the priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.16,0:19:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who we know as Father Poochie\Nisn't here anymore. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.14,0:19:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a revelation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.86,0:19:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not him either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of his abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He made an afterimage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:19:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Versus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Using the cover of the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the priest planted a past\Nmemory to this poor guy's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He used his own ability to\Ncraft an image of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.40,0:20:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The presence you were\Nfeeling earlier was Versus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.20,0:20:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Pucci took this chance to execute him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.56,0:20:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a revelation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.78,0:20:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It would seem there's something on my\Nside that can only be classified as fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.92,0:20:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The threads of fate are\Naiding me in reaching
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,heaven in three days during the new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were not for destiny, I\Nwould have surely been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.10,0:20:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You believe in gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the reason why every\None of you came here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can pursue me! Can pursue me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Can pursue me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The snails are all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.82,0:20:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.94,0:20:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Weather, Anastasia?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.18,0:20:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.72,0:20:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, did you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.78,0:20:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you not feel his presence anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you really\Ncan't tell where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.52,0:21:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yermis. He's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Call a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.04,0:21:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He should have healed\Nfrom the snails by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.58,0:21:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.68,0:21:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.00,0:21:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The rainbow disappeared too, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.38,0:21:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.02,0:21:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this because we crashed the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is it because I came after him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.76,0:21:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.70,0:21:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Plenty of people have\Ncalled me a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.40,0:22:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,At least that's what the newspapers said\Nabout me, and I don't necessarily disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.14,0:22:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,When people asked me if I would sacrifice\Nmyself for my family, I told them all no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think my answer\Nwould change even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.24,0:22:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When it came to my parents, my\Nheart was never moved by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.62,0:22:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.53,0:22:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'd be willing to\Nrisk my life for those that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.62,0:22:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,revived me from the dead\Nwithout a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.10,0:22:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It was like that for Weather, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.22,0:22:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.46,0:22:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When Pale Snake was focused\Non dealing the final blow,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.50,0:22:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,he took advantage of his special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.46,0:22:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He used that moment to seal\Nhis ability into a disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.32,0:22:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.30,0:22:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Weather entrusted this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.40,0:23:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather came back to life when he\Nfinally escaped from that prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.12,0:23:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the proof he left for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.60,0:23:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In his final few days, he was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.72,0:23:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather had already been saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.14,0:23:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.08,0:23:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.86,0:23:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.38,0:23:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to talk to you in the soft breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.78,0:24:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
